  <h1 align="center">Board of Directors</h1>
</div>
</div>


<div>
<div class="container section centered">
</div>
</div>


<div>
<div class="container">

<p>The Board plays a primary role in Corporate Governance by setting out the strategic direction of the Group, establishing goals and ensuring a high degree of transparency and accountability towards all stakeholders.</p>
<br><br>
<div class="team-block">
	<div class="col-md-3">
		<img src="https://www.vascon.com/images/corporate/rvasudevan.jpg" class="img-responsive" style="margin:0 auto;">
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-9">
		<div>
			<p><h4>R Vasudevan</h4>
			<b>-Chairman Emeritus</b></p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<p>
		     Mr. R. Vasudevan holds a bachelor’s degree in Civil Engineering from College of Engineering Pune. He has also completed Management 
		     Program from the Harward Business School. He has been a Promoter of the Company since <span class="num-font">January 1, 1986</span>. He has brought up the company from scratch to <span class="num-font">₹ 1000</span> Crore conglomerate now.
			</p>
			<p>
				He has been awarded several awards for his contribution in the field of construction and Real Estate Industry. He has been
                awarded the Top Management Consortium Award of Excellence for the year 2005, the “Construction World -Top Builder
                Award” in <span class="num-font">2007</span>, Award for Life Time Achievements by the Alumni Association of College of Engineering, Pune in <span class="num-font">2005</span> and
                the South Indian Education Society on the occasion of its Platinum Jubilee <span class="num-font">(1932-2008)</span> honored and felicitated Mr. R.
                Vasudevan as a distinguished alumnus. He has also been felicitated with Life Time Achievement Award of the Year at 9th
                Realty Plus Award Event. 
			</p>
			<p>
				Mr. R Vasudevan has been instrumental in bringing the company to the position of eminence over the last 4 decades. He is
                instrumental to introduce the JDA model of real estate development and this unique innovation in Real Estate industry has
                helped the company to grow to this size and stature. The EPC and Real Estate Business requires special skill set for timely
                execution of projects and monitoring on continuous basis. Mr. R. Vasudevan possesses these special skills and he has trained
                his team with these skills due to which the Company has earned its reputation.
			</p>
		
			<hr>
		</div>	
	</div>
</div>

	
